    "complexity": "Complex",
    "description": "Spooked augdunars gallop wildly about the paddock, biting and kicking as they run.",
    "disable": "Succeed at four of the following checks in any combination: Nature DC 14 (trained) to calm the animals, Intimidation DC 16 (untrained) to scare the augdunars away, Will DC 18 (trained) to avoid flinching and project confidence, causing the augdunars to veer away. For each success, the hazard takes a cumulative \u20131 penalty to attack rolls.",
